      "title": "منصرف شدن (monsaref shodan) — to change one's mind, to give up an idea",
      "headword": "منصرف شدن",
      "romanization": "monsaref shodan",
      "gloss": "to change one's mind, to give up an idea",
      "script": "perso-arabic",
