              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عقب انداختن ('aqab andâkhtan) — \"to put off, to delay\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جلسه را یک هفته عقب انداختند. jalase râ yek hafte 'aqab andâkhtand. They put the meeting off by a week."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "'aqab \"back\" + andâkhtan \"to throw\" (present stem andâz-): to throw something back."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عقب انداختن ('aqab andâkhtan) is literally \"to throw back\": 'aqab \"back\" is usually traced to Arabic 'aqab, and andâkhtan \"to throw\" is a native Persian verb listed in EtymDB."
            }
          ]
        },
