              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دانشگاه امتحانها را به تعویق انداخت. dâneshgâh emtehânhâ râ be ta'viq andâkht. The university postponed the exams."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal. Without an object: be ta'viq oftâdan — to be postponed."
            }
          ]
        },
