          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هماهنگ کردن (hamâhang kardan) — \"to coordinate, to arrange\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "من با همکارانم زمان جلسه را هماهنگ کردم. man bâ hamkârânam zamân-e jalase râ hamâhang kardam. I arranged the meeting time with my colleagues."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Hamâhang \"in harmony\": ham \"same\" + âhang \"tune\". Bâ kasi hamâhang kardan — to arrange something with someone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هماهنگ کردن (hamâhang kardan) is native Persian, built from ham \"same, together\" + âhang \"tune\", which EtymDB traces to Middle Persian āhang, + kardan. To coordinate is to put people in one tune."
            }
          ]
        },
